# 🎯 Objectives

The main objectives of the Vitrum Glass Production Planning ERP are:

1. Digitize production planning.
2. Reduce manual planning work.
3. Improve machine utilization.
4. Provide accurate production timelines.
5. Simplify bottle quantity management.
6. Improve packing allocation visibility.
7. Provide accurate daily production information.
8. Make production changes easy and fast.
9. Reduce planning errors.
10. Provide a centralized production planning system.

